        {
          "id": "stats-probability-conditional-independence-block-3",
          "html": "<marimo-island\n    data-app-id=\"mlphd\"\n    data-cell-id=\"SYQT\"\n    data-reactive=\"true\"\n>\n    <marimo-cell-output>\n    <span></span>\n    </marimo-cell-output>\n    <marimo-cell-code hidden>stats_exercise_01_description%20%3D%20mo.md(%22%22%22%0A%23%23%23%20Exercise%0A%0AImplement%20%60conditional(intersection%2C%20given)%60%20and%0A%60are_independent(p_a%2C%20p_b%2C%20p_both)%60.%0A%22%22%22)%0Astats_exercise_01_starter%20%3D%20mo.ui.code_editor(%0A%20%20%20%20value%3D'def%20conditional(intersection%2C%20given)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20intersection%20%2F%20given%5Cn%5Cndef%20are_independent(p_a%2C%20p_b%2C%20p_both)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20abs(p_both%20-%20p_a%20*%20p_b)%20%3C%201e-12'%2C%0A%20%20%20%20language%3D%22python%22%2C%20label%3D%22Your%20Python%20answer%22%2C%20min_height%3D180%2C%0A)%0Astats_exercise_01_submit%20%3D%20mo.ui.run_button(label%3D%22Submit%20answer%22)</marimo-cell-code>\n</marimo-island>",
          "visible": false
        },
        {
          "id": "stats-probability-conditional-independence-block-4",
          "html": "<marimo-island\n            data-app-id=\"mlphd\"\n            data-cell-id=\"bMrW\"\n            data-reactive=\"true\"\n        >\n            <marimo-cell-output><marimo-ui-element data-mlphd-island-source-guard hidden object-id='837e1a84-c95d-c661-a0b5-9f27ddf3d24f' random-id='837e1a84-c95d-c661-a0b5-9f27ddf3d24f'><marimo-code-editor data-initial-value='&quot;@assertion(lambda _ns: None)&#92;ndef _submission(source):&#92;n    _ns = execute_submission(source)&#92;n    assert abs(_ns[&#92;&quot;conditional&#92;&quot;](0.2, 0.5) - 0.4) &#92;u003c 1e-12&#92;n    assert _ns[&#92;&quot;are_independent&#92;&quot;](0.5, 0.4, 0.2) is True&#92;n    assert _ns[&#92;&quot;are_independent&#92;&quot;](0.5, 0.4, 0.1) is False&#92;n    return _ns&#92;n&#92;nproblem(mo, stats_exercise_01_description, stats_exercise_01_starter, _submission, stats_exercise_01_submit)&quot;' data-label='null' data-language='&quot;python&quot;' data-placeholder='&quot;&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-show-copy-button='true' data-debounce='false'></marimo-code-editor></marimo-ui-element>\n            <div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 1rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"exercise\">Exercise</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Implement <code>conditional(intersection, given)</code> and\n<code>are_independent(p_a, p_b, p_both)</code>.</span></span><marimo-ui-element object-id='SYQT-0' random-id='c4356f2d-4134-7c73-f0db-22acad73be85'><marimo-code-editor data-initial-value='&quot;def conditional(intersection, given):&#92;n    return intersection / given&#92;n&#92;ndef are_independent(p_a, p_b, p_both):&#92;n    return abs(p_both - p_a * p_b) &#92;u003c 1e-12&quot;' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eYour Python answer&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-language='&quot;python&quot;' data-placeholder='&quot;&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-min-height='180' data-show-copy-button='true' data-debounce='false'></marimo-code-editor></marimo-ui-element><marimo-ui-element object-id='SYQT-1' random-id='699ef302-8cec-d752-eb0c-6863d0e6bcf4'><marimo-button data-initial-value='0' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eSubmit answer&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;neutral&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-full-width='false'></marimo-button></marimo-ui-element><marimo-callout-output data-html='&quot;&#92;u003cspan&#92;u003eEdit the answer, then click Submit answer.&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;neutral&quot;'></marimo-callout-output></div>\n            </marimo-cell-output>\n            <marimo-cell-code hidden>%40assertion(lambda%20_ns%3A%20None)%0Adef%20_submission(source)%3A%0A%20%20%20%20_ns%20%3D%20execute_submission(source)%0A%20%20%20%20assert%20abs(_ns%5B%22conditional%22%5D(0.2%2C%200.5)%20-%200.4)%20%3C%201e-12%0A%20%20%20%20assert%20_ns%5B%22are_independent%22%5D(0.5%2C%200.4%2C%200.2)%20is%20True%0A%20%20%20%20assert%20_ns%5B%22are_independent%22%5D(0.5%2C%200.4%2C%200.1)%20is%20False%0A%20%20%20%20return%20_ns%0A%0Aproblem(mo%2C%20stats_exercise_01_description%2C%20stats_exercise_01_starter%2C%20_submission%2C%20stats_exercise_01_submit)</marimo-cell-code>\n        </marimo-island>",
