          "id": "stats-random-variables-distributions-block-3",
          "html": "<marimo-island\n    data-app-id=\"mlphd\"\n    data-cell-id=\"WfYj\"\n    data-reactive=\"true\"\n>\n    <marimo-cell-output>\n    <span></span>\n    </marimo-cell-output>\n    <marimo-cell-code hidden>stats_exercise_03_description%20%3D%20mo.md(%22%22%22%0A%23%23%23%20Exercise%0A%0AImplement%20%60distribution_for(scenario)%60%20for%20%60%22binary%22%60%2C%20%60%22fixed_trials%22%60%2C%0A%60%22event_count%22%60%2C%20%60%22waiting_time%22%60%2C%20and%20%60%22symmetric_measurement%22%60.%0A%22%22%22)%0Astats_exercise_03_starter%20%3D%20mo.ui.code_editor(%0A%20%20%20%20value%3D'def%20distribution_for(scenario)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20choices%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%22binary%22%3A%20%22bernoulli%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%22fixed_trials%22%3A%20%22binomial%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%22event_count%22%3A%20%22poisson%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%22waiting_time%22%3A%20%22exponential%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%22symmetric_measurement%22%3A%20%22normal%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20choices%5Bscenario%5D'%2C%0A%20%20%20%20language%3D%22python%22%2C%20label%3D%22Your%20Python%20answer%22%2C%20min_height%3D210%2C%0A)%0Astats_exercise_03_submit%20%3D%20mo.ui.run_button(label%3D%22Submit%20answer%22)</marimo-cell-code>\n</marimo-island>",
          "visible": false
        },
        {
          "id": "stats-random-variables-distributions-block-4",
          "html": "<marimo-island\n            data-app-id=\"mlphd\"\n            data-cell-id=\"Ynfw\"\n            data-reactive=\"true\"\n        >\n            <marimo-cell-output><marimo-ui-element data-mlphd-island-source-guard hidden object-id='eeee41e2-4b37-d82f-a506-138ee10be21f' random-id='eeee41e2-4b37-d82f-a506-138ee10be21f'><marimo-code-editor data-initial-value='&quot;@assertion(lambda _ns: None)&#92;ndef _submission(source):&#92;n    _ns = execute_submission(source)&#92;n    _fn = _ns[&#92;&quot;distribution_for&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    _expected = {&#92;&quot;binary&#92;&quot;: &#92;&quot;bernoulli&#92;&quot;, &#92;&quot;fixed_trials&#92;&quot;: &#92;&quot;binomial&#92;&quot;, &#92;&quot;event_count&#92;&quot;: &#92;&quot;poisson&#92;&quot;, &#92;&quot;waiting_time&#92;&quot;: &#92;&quot;exponential&#92;&quot;, &#92;&quot;symmetric_measurement&#92;&quot;: &#92;&quot;normal&#92;&quot;}&#92;n    assert all(_fn(_key) == _value for _key, _value in _expected.items())&#92;n    return _ns&#92;n&#92;nproblem(mo, stats_exercise_03_description, stats_exercise_03_starter, _submission, stats_exercise_03_submit)&quot;' data-label='null' data-language='&quot;python&quot;' data-placeholder='&quot;&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-show-copy-button='true' data-debounce='false'></marimo-code-editor></marimo-ui-element>\n            <div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 1rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"exercise\">Exercise</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Implement <code>distribution_for(scenario)</code> for <code>\"binary\"</code>, <code>\"fixed_trials\"</code>,\n<code>\"event_count\"</code>, <code>\"waiting_time\"</code>, and <code>\"symmetric_measurement\"</code>.</span></span><marimo-ui-element object-id='WfYj-0' random-id='0e5b151a-cf28-7403-437f-be52ffb070a8'><marimo-code-editor data-initial-value='&quot;def distribution_for(scenario):&#92;n    choices = {&#92;n        &#92;&quot;binary&#92;&quot;: &#92;&quot;bernoulli&#92;&quot;,&#92;n        &#92;&quot;fixed_trials&#92;&quot;: &#92;&quot;binomial&#92;&quot;,&#92;n        &#92;&quot;event_count&#92;&quot;: &#92;&quot;poisson&#92;&quot;,&#92;n        &#92;&quot;waiting_time&#92;&quot;: &#92;&quot;exponential&#92;&quot;,&#92;n        &#92;&quot;symmetric_measurement&#92;&quot;: &#92;&quot;normal&#92;&quot;,&#92;n    }&#92;n    return choices[scenario]&quot;' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eYour Python answer&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-language='&quot;python&quot;' data-placeholder='&quot;&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-min-height='210' data-show-copy-button='true' data-debounce='false'></marimo-code-editor></marimo-ui-element><marimo-ui-element object-id='WfYj-1' random-id='1c30a8fa-db6a-c36a-46ad-e414bcc27676'><marimo-button data-initial-value='0' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eSubmit answer&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;neutral&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-full-width='false'></marimo-button></marimo-ui-element><marimo-callout-output data-html='&quot;&#92;u003cspan&#92;u003eEdit the answer, then click Submit answer.&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;neutral&quot;'></marimo-callout-output></div>\n            </marimo-cell-output>\n            <marimo-cell-code hidden>%40assertion(lambda%20_ns%3A%20None)%0Adef%20_submission(source)%3A%0A%20%20%20%20_ns%20%3D%20execute_submission(source)%0A%20%20%20%20_fn%20%3D%20_ns%5B%22distribution_for%22%5D%0A%20%20%20%20_expected%20%3D%20%7B%22binary%22%3A%20%22bernoulli%22%2C%20%22fixed_trials%22%3A%20%22binomial%22%2C%20%22event_count%22%3A%20%22poisson%22%2C%20%22waiting_time%22%3A%20%22exponential%22%2C%20%22symmetric_measurement%22%3A%20%22normal%22%7D%0A%20%20%20%20assert%20all(_fn(_key)%20%3D%3D%20_value%20for%20_key%2C%20_value%20in%20_expected.items())%0A%20%20%20%20return%20_ns%0A%0Aproblem(mo%2C%20stats_exercise_03_description%2C%20stats_exercise_03_starter%2C%20_submission%2C%20stats_exercise_03_submit)</marimo-cell-code>\n        </marimo-island>",
          "visible": true
